W:Ding dong! merrily on high
W:In heav'n the bells are ringing:
W:Ding dong! verily the sky
W:Is riv'n with Angel singing.
W:Gloria; Hosanna in excelsis!
W:
W:(George Ratcliffe Woodward, 1924)

